  "basis": "Exact-QID OSM way368369459/Q2385650 preserves the complete curved crossing and approaches. Anchor [-60.678950356,-32.869225439], heading0.179910612468: +X east-northeast/Victoria, -X west-southwest/Rosario; +Z downstream/south-southeast, -Z upstream/north-northwest. The93.694m plan breadth describes curvature; nominal deck width is21.3m. Paired named RN174 PMTiles carriageway endpoints set landing centers. All24 mapped road-width samples per LOD have model support;18 retain native paving and meet within 0.0019998550415039062m. Six samples are inside replacement, not pavement joins. Main section/pylon stations and source grade are approximate. Eastern grade clears the highest sampled cross-road DEM; flared aprons cover the viewer’s wider default road ribbons. This is standard-viewer fit, not survey or legal-clearance certification.",
